      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "[ORIGINAL REPORT]",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tCONFIUGRE script must output summary of options someplace so they can be reloaded – maybe JSON?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tLIST OF TARGETS",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tUse that list in Library/buildall.pl – instead o fhardwiring Platofrm_Linux and DEBUG",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tMAYBE - -PLATFORM arg applies to BUILD program and is passed from level to level if specified. And the TARGETS are froma  “TARGETS file” – just LF-speparated list of ‘targets’ in each PLATFORM dir?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tALSO – have configure –target do more o rless what it does now – but configure with NO TARGETS specified – run (recursively) configure –target with PRESPECIFIED TARGETS!!!! Use that to make DEBUG and RELEASE DEFAULT TARGETS FOR UNIX!!!!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "[[ MY CURRENT TAKE ON THIS]]",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Should have ability (maybe even default) is that when you run configure, it AUGMENTS (starts wsith as default) the existing settings already configured. Or at least have that as ab option.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
